 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1008 "Our Calculus II course builds upon the differential calculus covered in Calculus I , providing in-depth coverage of integral calculus including integration techniques, applications of integration. Advanced topics such as series convergence tests, Taylor series, calculus with parametric and polar equations, and introductory differential equations are also covered. This comprehensive course will prepare students for further studies in advanced mathematics, engineering, statistics, machine learning, and other fields requiring a solid foundation in integral calculus." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1009 "Further your understanding of calculus: master advanced integration techniques, model real-world situations using differential equations, and more." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1012 106 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1013 "CA2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1014 #uuid "4965f9cc-fd21-5d50-b441-6e80983b17dd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049940 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050227 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186092350 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186092351 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186092352 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1031 "Introduction to Polar Coordinates" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1033 935 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1034 1.066059822325724 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186048292 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "91ea62c6-0e3b-57f1-86d6-615d0c3c21e6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049613 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049706 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049613 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186105758 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186049613 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 1759218